## placementHome.html

```html
<template>
    <lightning-card title="Placement Management System" icon-name="standard:people">

        <div class="container">

            <h1 class="title">Placement Portal</h1>

            <div class="card">
                <p><span class="label">Today's Date :</span> {todayDate}</p>
                <p><span class="label">Welcome :</span> Student</p>
                <p><span class="label">Number of Companies :</span> {companyCount}</p>
                <p><span class="label">Number of Jobs :</span> {jobCount}</p>
                <p><span class="label">Applications Submitted :</span> {applicationCount}</p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="heading">Student Details</h2>

            <div class="card">
                <p><span class="label">Student Name :</span> {studentName}</p>
                <p><span class="label">Roll Number :</span> {rollNumber}</p>
                <p><span class="label">Department :</span> {department}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="button-area">
                <lightning-button
                    label="Show Welcome Message"
                    variant="brand"
                    onclick={showMessage}>
                </lightning-button>

                <lightning-button
                    label="Apply"
                    variant="success"
                    onclick={applyJob}
                    class="applyBtn">
                </lightning-button>
            </div>

            <template if:true={isVisible}>
                <div class="message">
                    Welcome to Salesforce Development
                </div>
            </template>

            <div class="status">
                Status : {status}
            </div>

        </div>

    </lightning-card>
</template>
```

